WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.424 --> 00:00:15.005
Mandy looked at each other.

2
00:00:15.025 --> 00:00:18.767
"China?" they said together.

3
00:00:19.828 --> 00:00:22.670
Samir looked at them with great interest.

4
00:00:22.690 --> 00:00:27.093
"Tell me the secret of that trick you just did," he said.

5
00:00:27.113 --> 00:00:31.316
"We don't know," Vinnie admitted.

6
00:00:32.608 --> 00:00:34.409
"Ah, you do not wish to tell me?"

7
00:00:34.989 --> 00:00:35.909
Samir asked.

8
00:00:37.050 --> 00:00:41.072
"No, we really don't know," said Mandy.

9
00:00:42.172 --> 00:00:43.793
Samir laughed loudly.

10
00:00:47.474 --> 00:00:49.115
see me if you ever need a job.

11
00:00:50.415 --> 00:00:53.977
That trick could make me—I mean you—a lot of money."

12
00:00:55.537 --> 00:00:59.159
Samir walked behind a curtain at the back of the stage.

13
00:00:59.179 --> 00:01:01.260
"Look at that!"

14
00:01:02.052 --> 00:01:02.853
said Mandy.

15
00:01:03.993 --> 00:01:07.655
She could see a group of houses outside a nearby gate.

16
00:01:07.675 --> 00:01:11.998
"I count four buildings," said Vinnie.

17
00:01:12.018 --> 00:01:14.799
"Is it a little village?"

18
00:01:15.640 --> 00:01:16.420
asked Mandy.

19
00:01:16.440 --> 00:01:22.143
"Village?" said a laughing voice below them.

20
00:01:23.484 --> 00:01:25.965
The children looked down and saw a girl.

21
00:01:25.985 --> 00:01:31.028
"That is Master Yuan's courtyard house," the girl said.

22
00:01:32.016 --> 00:01:33.897
"Wealthy people live in such homes."

23
00:01:34.977 --> 00:01:37.258
She looked a bit older than Vinnie.

24
00:01:38.518 --> 00:01:41.639
Vinnie and Mandy jumped down from the stage.

25
00:01:42.719 --> 00:01:45.380
"You're new to Chang'an," she remarked.

26
00:01:45.400 --> 00:01:48.261
"Everyone knows Master Yuan.

27
00:01:49.161 --> 00:01:51.202
You must be with the visiting performers.

28
00:01:51.982 --> 00:01:53.743
The acrobats are my favorite."

29
00:01:55.743 --> 00:01:57.884
"Acrobats?" said Vinnie.

30
00:01:58.952 --> 00:02:02.234
The girl led them through a noisy crowd of performers.

31
00:02:03.275 --> 00:02:06.076
Jugglers were lifting umbrellas with their feet.

32
00:02:06.096 --> 00:02:08.458
"There they are!"

33
00:02:09.118 --> 00:02:09.859
cried Vinnie.

34
00:02:10.899 --> 00:02:13.721
Young girls were jumping and flipping in the air.

35
00:02:13.741 --> 00:02:17.183
"What's your name?"

36
00:02:17.883 --> 00:02:19.264
Mandy said to the girl.

37
00:02:19.284 --> 00:02:22.966
"I'm Mei-Li," the girl replied.

38
00:02:22.986 --> 00:02:25.688
"My parents are bakers.

39
00:02:26.428 --> 00:02:29.729
They made two hundred buns for Master Yuan's celebration."

40
00:02:30.849 --> 00:02:33.870
Mandy introduced herself and pointed to Vinnie.

41
00:02:33.890 --> 00:02:38.091
"And he's my brother Vinnie," she said.

42
00:02:38.111 --> 00:02:40.892
"What's the celebration for?"

43
00:02:40.912 --> 00:02:49.155
"Master Yuan's son Jinying has passed the first level of the imperial exams," explained Mei-Li.

44
00:02:49.175 --> 00:02:52.095
"What are they?"

45
00:02:52.976 --> 00:02:53.756
asked Mandy.

46
00:02:54.708 --> 00:02:56.309
"They are very difficult tests.

47
00:02:57.310 --> 00:03:03.134
There are three levels of exams, and each level is harder than the one before," said Mei-Li.

48
00:03:03.154 --> 00:03:07.717
"If all levels are passed, the person becomes a mandarin.

49
00:03:08.878 --> 00:03:11.319
A mandarin is a very respected official."

50
00:03:11.339 --> 00:03:15.542
"That's a lot of work," said Mandy.

51
00:03:16.803 --> 00:03:17.724
Mei-Li nodded.

52
00:03:17.744 --> 00:03:20.025
"It takes many years of study."

53
00:03:21.206 --> 00:03:24.676
Vinnie rejoined his sister and Mei-Li.

54
00:03:24.696 --> 00:03:28.278
They walked past two monkeys dressed in red costumes.

55
00:03:31.080 --> 00:03:32.300
The children giggled.

56
00:03:32.320 --> 00:03:36.102
"I have to go to the market," said Mei-Li.

57
00:03:36.122 --> 00:03:38.204
"It was nice meeting you."

58
00:03:38.224 --> 00:03:40.145
"Can we come with you?"

59
00:03:40.805 --> 00:03:41.465
asked Vinnie.

60
00:03:41.485 --> 00:03:44.227
"Sure," said Mei-Li.

61
00:03:44.807 --> 00:03:46.908
They walked toward a large gate.

62
00:03:48.289 --> 00:03:52.772
Then Mandy noticed a monkey trainer beating one of the two monkeys.

63
00:03:54.328 --> 00:03:55.608
"That's not right!"

64
00:03:56.289 --> 00:03:57.789
Mandy thought to herself.

65
00:03:58.909 --> 00:04:02.970
She marched over to the trainer as Vinnie and Mei-Li walked on.

66
00:04:02.990 --> 00:04:07.892
"You shouldn't hurt your animals," said Mandy.

67
00:04:07.912 --> 00:04:10.112
"Mind your own business!"

68
00:04:10.813 --> 00:04:11.813
yelled the trainer.

69
00:04:12.973 --> 00:04:15.994
He put the monkey in a cage and walked off.

70
00:04:17.895 --> 00:04:22.676
Vinnie and Mei-Li were already out of sight, walking toward the market.

71
00:04:23.800 --> 00:04:28.324
"Poor thing," said Mandy, as she walked over to the cage.

72
00:04:28.344 --> 00:04:31.486
"Don't worry, I'll save you."

73
00:04:33.307 --> 00:04:34.889
Mandy opened the cage.

74
00:04:36.210 --> 00:04:39.592
The monkey jumped out and ran across the square.

75
00:04:39.612 --> 00:04:42.534
"Wait! Come back!"

76
00:04:43.395 --> 00:04:44.296
Mandy shouted.
